## 9. L0 → L1 transition

Quantum dynamics at L0 is unitary:

\[
i\hbar \frac{\partial}{\partial t}\Psi = \hat{H}\Psi
\]

At L1, we no longer track the full wavefunction.

Instead, we track probability distributions over macrostates.

This transition is:

\[
\boxed{
L0 \to L1
=
\text{unitary microdescription}
\to
\text{statistical macrodescription}
}
\]

The price is entropy.  
The reward is predictability.

